{"id":"word:hebrew:H2931","type":"word","title":"טָמֵא","subtitle":"H2931 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"foul in a religious sense","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to טָמֵא (H2931) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 88 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"טָמֵא (ṭâmêʼ) means foul in a religious sense First listed occurrence: 2Chr 23 19."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"טָמֵא","transliteration":"ṭâmêʼ","pronunciation":"taw-may'","strong":"H2931","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2931","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["טָמֵ֥א","טָמֵ֖א","טָמֵ֣א","טְמֵאִ֥ים","הַ/טָּמֵ֖א"],"morphs":[["HAamsa",41],["HTd/Aamsa",11],["HAafsa",9],["HAampa",8],["HAamsc",4],["HR/Aamsa",2],["HAafsc",2],["HC/Aamsa",2],["HRd/Aamsa",2],["HTd/Aampa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"foul in a religious sense","usage":"defiled, infamous, polluted(-tion), unclean.","full":"H2931. tame II. טָמֵא adjective unclean ; — ׳ט Lev 5:2 58t.; construct טְמֵא 22:4 3 t.; feminine טְמֵאָה 5:2 11 t.; construct טְמֵאַת Ezek 22:5 , 10 ; plural טְמֵאִים Lev 11:8 10 t.; — unclean , 1 ethically and religiously ׳ט שׂפתים Isa 6:5 (twice in verse) unclean of lips ; ׳ט השׁם Ezek 22:5 defiled of name, infamous ; מִטּ ׳טהור Job 14:4 . 2 ritually : a. of persons , || טהור Deut 12:15 , 22 ; 15:22 ; Eccl 9:2 ; ׳ט נפשׁ Lev 22:4 (H); ( אדם ) ׳ט לנפשׁ unclean for a ( dead ) person Num 5:2 ; 9:6-7 , 10 (P) = ׳ט נפשׁ Hag 2:13 ; elsewhere for various reasons Deut 26:14 ; Lev 5:2 ; 13:11 , 16 , 44 , 45 (twice in verse); 13:46 ; 15:2 , 25 , 33 ; Num 19:13 , 17 , 19 , 20 , 22 (all P), 2Chr 23:19 ; Isa 64:5 ; Ezek 4:13 ; 22:10 ; Lam 4:15 . b. of animals Lev 5:2 (4 t. in verse); 7:21 (twice in verse); 11:4-5 , 6 , 7 , 8 , 26 , 27 , 28 , 29 , 31 ; 27:11 , 27 ; Num 18:15 (all P), Lev 20:25 (twice in verse) (H), Deut 14:7-8 , 10 , 19 . c. of things in Gen . Lev 11:35 (twice in verse); 11:38 ; 15:26 ; Num 19:15 (all P), Isa 52:11 ; food Judg 13:4 ; Hosea 9:3 ; houses Jer 19:13 ; leprosy Lev 13:15 , 51 , 55 ; 14:44 , 57 (P); offering Hag 2:14 . d. persons and things in General טמא כל Lev 7:19 , 21 (P); הט בין ׳הבדיל הטהור ובין 10:10 ; 11:47 ; (ה)ט בין ׳הודיע לטהור Ezek 22:26 ; 44:23 ; of aliens Isa 52:1 (|| עָרֵל ), perhaps also 35:8 . 3 specifically of places : ט ׳מקום unclean place (place of refuse away from holy place and human habitation) Lev 14:40-41 , 45 (P); ארץ טמאה land on the east of the Jordan separated from the land of the tabernacle of ׳י Josh 22:19 (P); so ט ׳אדמה a foreign land Amos 7:17 .","rootNote":"from 2930 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 23 19","keyReferences":["2Chr 23 19","Amos 7 17","Deut 12 15","Deut 12 22","Deut 14 7","Deut 14 8","Deut 14 10","Deut 14 19"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":88,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 23 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":23,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"טָמֵ֖א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Amos 7 17","book":"Amos","chapter":7,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"טְמֵאָה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAafsa"},{"reference":"Deut 12 15","book":"Deut","chapter":12,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/טָּמֵ֤א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"Deut 12 22","book":"Deut","chapter":12,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/טָּמֵא֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"Deut 14 7","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"טְמֵאִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAampa"},{"reference":"Deut 14 8","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"טָמֵ֥א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Deut 14 10","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"טָמֵ֥א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"Deut 14 19","book":"Deut","chapter":14,"vers